akes” theme. It served we well, but like so many Jekyll themes it got abandoned in recent years, so I’ve been shopping recently for a good actively-maintained alternative.","tags":["#clippings","#jekyll","#blog"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"Clippings/A Fresh Look for the Blog Switching to Jekyll’s Chirpy Theme.md"},
